{"id":100,"name":"العاديات","transliteration":"Al-'Adiyat","translation_fr":"Les coursiers","translation_en":"The Courser","type":"meccan","total_verses":11,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلۡعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبۡحٗا","translation_fr":"Par les coursiers qui halètent","translation_en":"By the racers, panting","transliteration":"WaalAAadiyati dabhan"},{"id":2,"text":"فَٱلۡمُورِيَٰتِ قَدۡحٗا","translation_fr":"qui font jaillir des étincelles","translation_en":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","transliteration":"Faalmooriyati qadhan"},{"id":3,"text":"فَٱلۡمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبۡحٗا","translation_fr":"qui attaquent au matin","translation_en":"And the chargers at dawn","transliteration":"Faalmugheerati subhan"},{"id":4,"text":"فَأَثَرۡنَ بِهِۦ نَقۡعٗا","translation_fr":"et font ainsi voler la poussière","translation_en":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust","transliteration":"Faatharna bihi naqAAan"},{"id":5,"text":"فَوَسَطۡنَ بِهِۦ جَمۡعًا","translation_fr":"et pénètrent au centre de la troupe ennemie","translation_en":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively","transliteration":"Fawasatna bihi jamAAan"},{"id":6,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٞ","translation_fr":"L'homme est, certes, ingrat envers son Seigneur","translation_en":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful","transliteration":"Inna alinsana lirabbihi lakanoodun"},{"id":7,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٞ","translation_fr":"et pourtant, il est certes, témoin de cela","translation_en":"And indeed, he is to that a witness","transliteration":"Wainnahu AAala thalika lashaheedun"},{"id":8,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلۡخَيۡرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","translation_fr":"et pour l'amour des richesses il est certes ardent","translation_en":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense","transliteration":"Wainnahu lihubbi alkhayri lashadeedun"},{"id":9,"text":"۞أَفَلَا يَعۡلَمُ إِذَا بُعۡثِرَ مَا فِي ٱلۡقُبُورِ","translation_fr":"Ne sait-il donc pas que lorsque ce qui est dans les tombes sera bouleversé","translation_en":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","transliteration":"Afala yaAAlamu itha buAAthira ma fee alquboori"},{"id":10,"text":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِي ٱلصُّدُورِ","translation_fr":"et que sera dévoilé ce qui est dans les poitrines","translation_en":"And that within the breasts is obtained","transliteration":"Wahussila ma fee alssudoori"},{"id":11,"text":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمۡ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّخَبِيرُۢ","translation_fr":"ce jour-là, certes, leur Seigneur sera Parfaitement Connaisseur d'eux","translation_en":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted","transliteration":"Inna rabbahum bihim yawmaithin lakhabeerun"}]}